      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "LUMI: FOREST ADVENTURE\n\r\nYour Goal:\r\nControl the brave fox Lumi and
    overcome the obstacles in the forest. Collect the target number of roses before
    time runs out and safely deliver them to your friend ILO at the end of the level!\n\r\nControls:\r\nA
    / D Keys: Move Left and Right\r\nSPACE: Jump\r\nG Key: Deliver collected roses
    to ILO\r\nESC: Pause Game (Menu)\n\r\nHow to Win:\r\nCollect enough roses before
    the time is up, reach ILO, and press the 'G' key to hand them over. Be careful-if
    you hit the obstacles or reach ILO without enough roses, you will lose! \nYou
    must be fast!"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
